 to live in peace. Our protagonist, Momo, lives a repressed life but still wishes to coexist with the enemy, the vampires. Fine, the vampire queen, once loved humans and disappeared from the battlefield. As war rages through the humans’ town, the two have a fateful encounter. Once upon a time, humans and vampires lived in harmony in a place called Paradise. This is the story of a young girl and a vampire on a journey to find Paradise.\n\n(Source: Netflix)"},"tags":[{"name":"Vampire","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":93,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":93,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Travel","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Dystopian","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":81,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Snowscape","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Foreign","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":65,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Guns","rank":64,"spoiler":false},{"name":"LGBTQ+ Themes","rank":63,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Gore","rank":61,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fugitive","rank":61,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":48,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":42,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Vampire in the Garden","english":"Vampire in the Garden","native":"ヴァンパイア・イン・ザ・ガーデン","romaji":"Vampire in the Garden","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"花园里的吸血鬼"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"花園裡的吸血鬼"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"英文名|Vampire in the Garden"}]},"trailer":{"id":"wl6tSENVhoQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wl6tSENVhoQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}